Adapted data
------------

crates/ftgsxr-render/src/gpu/shaders/centers.wgsl's VIRIDIS table holds 17 entries of the viridis
colormap, taken from matplotlib's colormap data, as its
comment says. Change: 17 of the 256 entries, at indices round(k · 255 / 16), interpolated linearly.

